/*
 * Aggregates binary operators related to bool operands.
 *
 * This module groups all binary operators whose semantics involve `bool`
 * values. Boolean operators differ from arithmetic or bitwise operators because
 * they operate on logical truth values rather than numeric data.
 *
 * The grouped operator families include:
 *
 *   - comparison operators (equality / inequality on booleans),
 *   - logical operators (AND, OR, XOR, etc.) that combine boolean expressions.
 * 
 * <hr>
 * 
 * @Package: ymirc        
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::value::operator::binary::bool_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/value/operator/binary/bool_.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created (YYYY-MM-DD): 2025-01-04
